ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B2fBS8txAH4Q7kNvwGz-owy&_nc_oc=Adoe4aTvb0XwUInXR-64js2WsKl8xmY5_kwgJj7WTzZANm1BdthJyjKQU4ArRPSL8Ds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOT6FVXXaTS5jBr-Nwr6u4TqBgTwWGpyhgO-jBKv_bdCQ&oe=6AE3647C"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KVqzUk0YCn8Q7kNvwE9Gxe6&_nc_oc=Ado2vg8_Bmvte4jMq8QOnVX1sunnqNNYePTsxgQYnvEd3H2XHC8oFxXAFFhP7pogk_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMGrJ2uFf0AzqgcuCT7WLT8CQZKPJKzd63rVyFqCCOGwg&oe=6AE34896"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fQgLjyz9vZoQ7kNvwGBrED_&_nc_oc=AdoGQN7scfMD--rHaPfb3RUCeA1hpc6qDMnTHRZEbTYXrWtGxM4gUz6pi8ck0MQ31uk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNsIOSuHTVfi6oW-qTg_KRMb_nZxxWlRQZ3S8GlirKhYA&oe=6AE35664"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_